        {
         "id": "b_5ad4vn62",
         "type": "text",
         "props": {
          "html": "<p>The practical bit: join at Split from three, sail at six. The airport is twenty minutes round the bay and we book the flights where wanted. Nyren carries a lift and two step-free cabins, and most harbours here take the gangway. Travel insurance is a condition of booking.</p>"
         }
        }
